  "content": "<div id=\"readability-page-1\" class=\"page\"><div id=\"SITE_CONTAINER\"><p><span>top of page</span></p><div id=\"site-root\"><main id=\"PAGES_CONTAINER\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-main-content=\"true\"><div data-mesh-id=\"Containervn5tninlineContent\" data-testid=\"inline-content\" id=\"SITE_PAGES\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-block-level-container=\"ClassicSection\"><!--$--><div id=\"comp-mo1gzle6\" data-testid=\"richTextElement\"><p><span>Manabu Kosaka &nbsp;<br>\nHandmade Paper Sculptures</span></p>\n\n<p><span><span>​</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span>Transforming everyday objects into precise sculptural forms using only paper.</span></p>\n\n<p><span>Each work is entirely handmade, built through a process of cutting, assembling, and refining paper into highly detailed objects. &nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p><span>​</span></p></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id=\"comp-mo1ilhel\" title=\"IMG_2599.jpg\"><p><img fetchpriority=\"high\" sizes=\"798px\" srcset=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/387403_0293c29222984ad3b49242075e4488d3~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_798,h_599,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/IMG_2599_edited.jpg 1x, https://static.wixstatic.com/media/387403_0293c29222984ad3b49242075e4488d3~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_1596,h_1198,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/IMG_2599_edited.jpg 2x\" id=\"img_comp-mo1ilhel\" src=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/387403_0293c29222984ad3b49242075e4488d3~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_798,h_599,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/IMG_2599_edited.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_2599_edited.jpg\" width=\"798\" height=\"599\"></p></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id=\"comp-mo1hgczx\" title=\"IMG_4179.2.jpg\"><p><img fetchpriority=\"high\" sizes=\"798px\" srcset=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/387403_dd6021bc317449adb37a14bfb90079e5~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_798,h_599,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/387403_dd6021bc317449adb37a14bfb90079e5~mv2.jpg 1x, https://static.wixstatic.com/media/387403_dd6021bc317449adb37a14bfb90079e5~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_1596,h_1198,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/387403_dd6021bc317449adb37a14bfb90079e5~mv2.jpg 2x\" id=\"img_comp-mo1hgczx\" src=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/387403_dd6021bc317449adb37a14bfb90079e5~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_798,h_599,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/387403_dd6021bc317449adb37a14bfb90079e5~mv2.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"798\" height=\"599\"></p></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id=\"comp-mo1i008r\" data-testid=\"richTextElement\"><p><span>Each work is created entirely by hand using paper.</span></p>\n\n<p><span>The process involves cutting, shaping, and assembling small components over an extended period of time. &nbsp;<br>\nThrough repetition and precision, the material gradually transforms into a solid and detailed object.</span></p>\n\n<p><span><span>​</span></span></p></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id=\"comp-mnj3sj1x\" title=\"#256-3.jpg\"><p><img loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"764px\" srcset=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/387403_8e6b136a61c14352a062f982a3723d88~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_764,h_573,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/387403_8e6b136a61c14352a062f982a3723d88~mv2.jpg 1x, https://static.wixstatic.com/media/387403_8e6b136a61c14352a062f982a3723d88~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_1528,h_1146,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/387403_8e6b136a61c14352a062f982a3723d88~mv2.jpg 2x\" id=\"img_comp-mnj3sj1x\" src=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/387403_8e6b136a61c14352a062f982a3723d88~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_764,h_573,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/387403_8e6b136a61c14352a062f982a3723d88~mv2.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"764\" height=\"573\"></p></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id=\"comp-mo1gyy5p\" data-testid=\"richTextElement\"><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>Title: #256 [BCL Radio]<br>\nYear: 2022</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>Material: Paper<br>\nSize: 220 × 180 × 70 mm (variable)</span></span></span></span></span></span></p